#: ../../technical/articles/106-profile-session-authority-access-leases-and-delegation.md:20
msgid ""
"The common evaluator binds each lease to the exact profile custody, lock "
"generation, runtime boot, connection, authenticated client, active login,"
" and both UTC and monotonic expiry. Automation additionally requires a "
"current active grant, exact key and generation lineage, bounded scope and"
" expiry, enabled custody, and eligible unattended operating-system login "
"for unattended API-key leases. Delegation produces a child on a "
"separately verified recipient connection; its scope is intersected with "
"parent, grant, and recipient scope, and its lifetime cannot exceed the "
"parent's remaining budget. Refresh applies only to a root API-key lease "
"and retires its children so a renewed time budget is never silently "
"inherited. session_authority_policy.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/session_authority_policy.py`) "
